t-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"异源通路重构\">异源通路重构</h3><p>将外源生物合成途径引入工业宿主是代谢工程的经典任务：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>通路挖掘</strong>：从文献、数据库（KEGG、MetaCyc、BRENDA）或宏基因组中发掘目标通路的酶基因</li>\n<li><strong>宿主适配</strong>：密码子优化、启动子适配、信号肽调整确保外源基因在新宿主中高效表达</li>\n<li><strong>中间体毒性管理</strong>：某些中间代谢物对宿主有毒（如法尼基焦磷酸FPP），需平衡各步酶活以避免积累</li>\n<li><strong>热力学可行性验证</strong>：计算通路每步反应的标准自由能变化<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G&#x27;^{\\circ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，确保整体热力学驱动力为负</li>\n</ol>\n<p>经典案例——青蒿素前体（青蒿酸）在酿酒酵母中的异源合成：将植物源甲羟戊酸途径（MVA）的8个酶基因引入酵母，通过上调<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tHMGR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">GR</span></span></span></span></span>消除限速步骤，最终滴度达25 g/L。</p>\n<h3 id=\"辅因子工程\">辅因子工程</h3><p>辅因子（NADH/NADPH、ATP、CoA等）是代谢反应的电子与能量载体，其供需平衡直接影响产物收率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NADPH再生</strong>：引入异源转氢酶（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pntAB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>）或葡萄糖-6-磷酸脱氢酶过表达</li>\n<li><strong>ATP驱动</strong>：通过非氧化磷酸化或ATP水解耦合驱动热力学不利反应</li>\n<li><strong>辅因子切换</strong>：通过酶的辅因子偏好性改造（如将NADH依赖型酶改为NADPH依赖型），匹配代谢网络中辅因子的实际供应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>辅因子平衡约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>NADPH</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>稳态下NADPH生成=消耗</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j v_j \\cdot \\delta_{j,\\text{NADPH}} = 0 \\quad (\\text{稳态下NADPH生成=消耗})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">NADPH</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稳态下</span><span class=\"mord\">NADPH</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生成</span><span class=\"mord\">=</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消耗</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"动态调控策略\">动态调控策略</h3><p>静态过表达/敲除往往在生长期与生产期之间产生冲突。动态调控使细胞在不同阶段自动切换代谢模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>群体感应（QS）驱动</strong>：利用细胞密度依赖的QS系统（如LuxI/LuxR），在高密度时自动激活生产途径</li>\n<li><strong>生物传感器调控</strong>：以中间代谢物为信号分子，通过转录因子型传感器实时反馈调节酶表达</li>\n<li><strong>温度/光响应开关</strong>：外部物理信号触发表达切换，避免化学诱导剂的成本与毒性</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;生长期&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;QS信号积累&quot;| B[&quot;切换点&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;生产期&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;高通量生长&quot;| A&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;高通量合成&quot;| C\">graph LR\n    A[\"生长期\"] --&gt;|\"QS信号积累\"| B[\"切换点\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"生产期\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"高通量生长\"| A\n    C --&gt;|\"高通量合成\"| C</pre><h3 id=\"计算机辅助通路设计\">计算机辅助通路设计</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>RetroPath/XTMS</strong>：逆合成分析工具，从目标产物出发搜索到已知前体的生化路径</li>\n<li><strong>OptKnock/OptForce</strong>：基于FBA的基因敲除/过表达策略自动优化</li>\n<li><strong>Selenzyme</strong>：酶序列推荐引擎，按底物相似性与宿主兼容性排序候选酶</li>\n<li><strong>DBTL集成平台</strong>：ART（Automated Recommendation Tool）结合机器学习推荐下一轮实验设计</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年代谢通路设计领域亮点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DeepMind发布MetaDesign——将AlphaFold预测酶结构与FBA代谢模型整合，自动生成&quot;从零开始&quot;的生物合成路线</li>\n<li>动态调控领域出现&quot;双层开关&quot;策略：QS启动粗调 + 产物传感器精调，使丁二酸产量波动降至±5%</li>\n<li>基于大语言模型的通路文献挖掘工具（PathwayGPT）可自动从10万篇论文中提取酶反应信息</li>\n<li>中国科学院天津工业生物技术研究所实现CO₂到淀粉的11步人工通路，效率达到光合作用的8.5倍</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用FBA方法，如果大肠杆菌的理论最大乙醇产率为<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> mol/mol glucose</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\text{ mol/mol glucose}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> mol/mol glucose</span></span></span></span></span></span>，但实际产率仅0.8 mol/mol，分析可能的碳流&quot;泄漏&quot;途径并提出优化策略。</li>\n<li>设计一个动态调控方案：在大肠杆菌生长至<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>600</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OD_{600}=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">600</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>后自动切换至番茄红素高产模式。说明你会选用什么传感器/开关系统。</li>\n<li>异源通路重构中&quot;中间体瓶颈&quot;如何诊断？提出至少两种实验方法来定位限速步骤。</li>\n<li>辅因子工程中，NADPH供给过剩可能带来什么副作用？如何在设计中规避？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>代谢通路设计是系统性工程——从FBA/MFA定量分析代谢网络，到异源通路的精准重构与热力学验证，再到辅因子平衡与动态调控的精细管理。计算工具（RetroPath、OptKnock、机器学习）正在大幅缩短设计迭代周期。核心原则是&quot;了解碳流去向、移除竞争消耗、驱动通量向产物倾斜&quot;，而动态调控则让细胞智能地协调生长与生产的双重需求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代谢通路设计","id":"代谢通路设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"代谢流分析方法","id":"代谢流分析方法"},{"level":3,"text":"异源通路重构","id":"异源通路重构"},{"level":3,"text":"辅因子工程","id":"辅因子工程"},{"level":3,"text":"动态调控策略","id":"动态调控策略"},{"level":3,"text":"计算机辅助通路设计","id":"计算机辅助通路设计"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"底盘细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/chassis-cell-engineering"},"next":{"title":"酶工程与生物催化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/enzyme-engineering"}}